  "method_statement": "For every control in control_by_control_receipt.v1.json carrying a volume-solids semantic, the mix volume-solids % was recomputed BOTH ways with exact rational arithmetic (fractions.Fraction, floats only at final 4dp rounding): (1) CORRECT volume-weighted: total solids volume / total mix volume * 100, component volume = mass/density - the only valid way to combine volume-basis percentages of components with different densities; (2) INVALID mass-fraction-weighted: sum(mass_fraction_i * vol_pct_i) - valid only if all densities are equal (false in both controls: 1.51 vs 0.92 and 1.64 vs 0.95 g/mL). A control is flagged as conflated when its receipt 'actual' lies within 0.2pp of method (2) but not method (1) - the same 'closely reproduces' band the refuting receipt used.",
